GPL-2.0 NOTICE -- BC-250 amdgpu liberation patch series
========================================================

The patch files here — the liberation series in `bc250-cachyos-7.2.9/*.patch`
and the build-plumbing `rust-abi-rename.patch` — are diffs against the Linux
kernel (the amdgpu driver / AMD SMU code, and the Rust target-spec generator).
Because they are derivative works of the Linux kernel, they are licensed
GPL-2.0-only — the same license as the code they modify and the same license as
this project (GPL-2.0-only, matching upstream cachenetics/project-ariel).

`rust-abi-rename.patch` is NOT a member of the liberation series: it unlocks no
silicon and carries no runtime tell, so `aputune patches` never counts it. It
only renames the Rust target-spec ABI value that older kernels hard-code to the
spelling rustc uses today, so kernel Rust keeps compiling on a newer toolchain.

